cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gWorld or MWMBench, please cite the paper below."
title: "gWorld: Mobile GUI World Model via Renderable Code Generation"
abstract: "gWorld (GuiWorld) is an open-weight GUI world model for mobile GUI agents: a single vision-language model (8B / 32B) that predicts the next screen after a user action by generating renderable HTML/web code instead of pixels."
